---
system: sys-01-identity-household-access
flow_id: signup
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/01-identity-household-access#4-1-post-v1authsignup
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway, IdentityService, SES]
apis:
  - POST /v1/auth/signup
externals: [SES]
queues: [auth.email]
failure_paths:
  - account_exists
  - weak_password
  - invalid_timezone
  - missing_required_consent
  - signup_rate_limited
  - signup_transaction_failed
idempotency: client-supplied X-Request-Id, 24h dedup window
retry: caller-side exponential backoff with jitter on 5xx — never retry on 4xx
timeout: 5s p99
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED. Normalized from spec sequenceDiagram at 01-identity-household-access.md#L353 — DB-transaction depth intentionally stripped per plan §0.1.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant IdentityService
    participant SES

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/auth/signup {email, password, displayName, timezone, locale, acceptances, X-Request-Id}
    Gateway->>Gateway: rate-limit (sys-17) — auth_signup — 10 per 15min per IP
    Gateway->>IdentityService: forward request
    alt signup_rate_limited
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 429 signup_rate_limited
    else weak_password
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 422 weak_password
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 422
    else invalid_timezone
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 422 invalid_timezone
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 422
    else missing_required_consent
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 422 missing_required_consent
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 422
    else account_exists
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 409 account_exists
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 409
    else signup_transaction_failed
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 500 signup_transaction_failed
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 500
    else success
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 201 {access_token, refresh_token, parentAccount, household}
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 201
        IdentityService-)SES: (async via queue auth.email) welcome email
    end

    Note over ParentApp,IdentityService: timeout 5s p99 — caller-side retry with jitter on 5xx only — idempotent via X-Request-Id (24h dedup)
